    "turn_text": "Well, when you bring up NATO, which anticipates a question that I was going to ask, because Article 5 of the NATO Charter, as you know, paraphrasing says, an attack on one is an attack on all. And it's only been invoked one time. And that was less than 24 hours after the attacks of September 11th in 2001. How strong is the Alliance today? In essence, reflect on where the Alliance is 18 years later.",
