    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73245.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "And I'm wondering, do you see yourself as sort of filling that role of the senior statesmen on the global stage, reassuring the world, especially our allies who haven't been talked to nicely of late, that the United States hasn't gone bonkers?",
