    "turn_text": "Let me jump on a phrase you just used, and that's common ground to bring the conversation here at home, and particularly in this building. And I'm thinking of the USMCA, which is basically NAFTA 2.0. Senator Portman wrote an op-ed in our paper, basically calling on you, bring USMCA to the floor for a vote. It'll be passed in the Senate, and the president will sign it, and it'll be a big win for workers, and so on and so forth. Where do things stand on USMCA? And will it come up for a vote?",
